{
  "_readme": "Repo-shared Claude Code settings for mimicwarehouse (decision D-39; GOVERNANCE.md section 4). These deny rules keep Claude sessions from reading licensed patient-level data (PhysioNet Credentialed Health Data License 1.5.0) via the Read/Grep/Glob tools or shell commands, and from opening DuckDB catalogs directly. All data access must go through mimicwarehouse.safe.safe_query / `mwh sql` (read-only, k=11 suppression, audit-logged). Deny rules take precedence over allow rules and cannot be overridden by settings.local.json. Do not weaken without updating GOVERNANCE.md and DECISIONS.md.",
